From 1d309879d60d9a86d14ddf8a4116aac4513519a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Vit <martin@voipmonitor.org>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 08:13:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Prevent terminal responses from waiting for unrelated
 generations

Give terminal cache snapshots lifecycle priority after owned probe verification
and queued GPU work drain. Every bounded cohort includes the oldest eligible
terminal request. Preserve snapshot publication and resource-fence ordering
across shared cache geometries, without model-specific policy or package changes.

Include a standalone streaming reproducer and scheduler regressions. The
regression fails on unchanged 3edd2c3a with 67 decodes and zero snapshots after
1.005 simulated seconds. This rebased tree passes 1,227 library tests, 22 ignored;
the root test process drops DAC override capabilities for filesystem-permission
coverage. Earlier same-package DS4.1 TP4 HTTP checks reduced final-token to
finish_reason delay from 18.284 s to 0.162 ms / 9.002 ms while a long request continued.
Those GPU checks predate this rebase; exact-tree native measurement is pending.

Design-Signed-Off-By: Codex (GPT-6); design-review=6aeb
